<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-009" chapter-id="c-jinshu-009-jin076-wangbiaozhi" source-id="s-jinshu-009-jin076-wangbiaozhi">
  <p id="c-jinshu-009-jin076-wangbiaozhi:appointment" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">丙申，以尚書僕射<persName id="c-jinshu-009-jin076-wangbiaozhi:appointment:m0008" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBB">王彪之</persName>爲尚書令，吏部尚書<persName id="c-jinshu-009-jin076-wangbiaozhi:appointment:m0020" ref="aa6_83c_juy_B">謝安</persName>爲尚書僕射，</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-009-jin076-wangbiaozhi:death" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">壬寅。散騎常侍、左光祿大夫、尚書令<persName id="c-jinshu-009-jin076-wangbiaozhi:death:m0017" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDBB">王彪之</persName>卒。</p>
</text>
